        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we are actively developing 1,796 multifamily units, 697 single family units, 3.7 million square feet of commercial and industrial space, and 3.5 million square feet of office and retail space.",
